---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SeriesBox from '../components/SeriesBox.astro';

// Clean title of any HTML tags
const pageTitle = "REPLACE_WITH_META_TITLE";
---
<Layout
  title={pageTitle}
  description="REPLACE_WITH_META_DESCRIPTION"
  isArticle={true}
  showPrintCover={true}
  printCoverTitle="REPLACE_WITH_BLOG_TITLE"
  printCoverSubtitle="C2 Club Special Edition · Career Insights"
>
  <main class="article-main" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <div class="article-container" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <a href="/blog/index.html" class="back-link" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>&larr; Back to blog</a> <article class="blog-article" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <header class="article-header" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <h1 class="article-title" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>REPLACE_WITH_BLOG_TITLE</h1> <div class="article-meta" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <span data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>REPLACE_DATE</span> <span class="meta-dot" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>&middot;</span> <span class="read-time" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>REPLACE_READ_TIME</span> </div> <button id="download-pdf-btn" onclick="window.print()">Download PDF</button> <hr class="article-meta-divider" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> </header> <img src="REPLACE_IMAGE_PATH" alt="Descriptive alt text" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;display:block;margin:20px auto;border-radius:12px;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <div class="article-body" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <!-- Blog content goes here --> <!-- Use proper H2, H3 structure --> <!-- No multiple H1 tags --> <!-- Use semantic headings --> <h2 data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Introduction</h2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Start your blog post with a compelling introduction that hooks the reader and explains what they will
            learn.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Main Section Heading</h2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Your main content goes here. Break it into logical sections with H2 and H3 headings.</p> <h3 data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Subsection Example</h3> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Use H3 for subsections within your main sections.</p> <h2 data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Conclusion</h2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Summarize key takeaways and provide a clear closing thought.</p> </div> <section class="faq-section" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <h2 data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2> <details class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <summary data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Question 1?</summary> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Answer to question 1...</p> </div> </details> <details class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <summary data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Question 2?</summary> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Answer to question 2...</p> </div> </details> <details class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <summary data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Question 3?</summary> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <p data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Answer to question 3...</p> </div> </details> </section> </article> <!-- PDF End Page (Print Only) --> <div class="print-only print-end-page" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; color: #22c55e;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>📌 Ready to build real connections?</h2> <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #444; max-width: 650px; margin: 20px auto; line-height: 1.6;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>
Reading about careers is only Step 1. The real value comes when you start engaging with peers and seniors in a structured environment.
</p> <div class="invitation-box" style="margin-top: 30px; padding: 32px; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 8px;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <p style="margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #000;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>
We unlocked the ultimate student collaboration hub inside the free C2 Club App.
</p> <p style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: #444; line-height: 1.5;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>
Connect with verified peers, find mentors, and get real career advice from students who have been there. Don't build your network alone.
</p> <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.c2club.uniqueapp" style="display: inline-block; background: #22c55e; color: #000; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.1rem;" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>👉 Click Here to Join C2 Club Instantly</a> </div> </div> <div class="article-footer-cta" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <hr class="article-divider" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <div class="cta-block-minimal" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2> <h3 class="cta-heading-subtle" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Continue the conversation.</h3> <p class="cta-text-subtle" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Join students across campuses building structured collaboration.</p> <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.c2club.uniqueapp" class="btn btn-primary" data-astro-cid-yp4ptqp2>Download C2 Club</a> </div> </div> <script type="module">document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",function(){const t=document.querySelector(".article-body"),e=document.querySelector(".read-time");if(t&&e){const n=(t.innerText||t.textContent).trim().split(/\s+/).length,o=Math.ceil(n/200);e.textContent=o+" min read"}});</script> </div> </main>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  
</style>
